    "\n",
    "| Task | Loss function |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Regression | Mean Squared Error (MSE) |\n",
    "| Binary classification | Binary cross-entropy |\n",
    "| Multi-class classification | Categorical cross-entropy |\n",
    "\n",
    "After a forward pass, the loss compares the prediction with the true label. Training aims to make this loss smaller."
